{"data":{"status":true,"competition":{"id":1744177,"visibility":"public","theme_colour":"blue_un","paid":0,"title":"Chemi-Thone","festival_id":504454,"organization_id":675999,"web_url":"www.techfest26.com\/","start_date":"2026-09-02T18:30:00+05:30","end_date":"2026-10-15T21:16:25+05:30","location":null,"type":"competitions","public_url":"competitions\/chemi-thone-techfest26-annual-technical-festival-of-sliet-sant-longowal-institute-of-engineering-and-techno-1744177","region":"online","details":"<p><strong>All That You Need to Know About Cemi-Thone &mdash; techFEST'26<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>About techFEST'26<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>techFEST'26 is North India's premier technical festival, organised by Sant Longowal Institute of Engineering and Technology (SLIET), Longowal, Punjab.<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Registration for the&nbsp;techFEST&rsquo;26 package&nbsp;is compulsory for&nbsp;accommodation and&nbsp;other perks, while&nbsp;participation in individual&nbsp;events is free*.<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong><a href=\"http:\/\/www.techfest26.com\/\">www.techfest26.com<\/a><\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p><strong>Register Now:<\/strong><br \/><a href=\"https:\/\/www.techfest26.com\/package\">https:\/\/www.techFEST26.com\/package<\/a><\/p>\n<p><strong>Website and Email:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Website: <a href=\"http:\/\/www.techfest26.com\/\">www.techfest26.com<\/a><\/li>\n<li>Email: <a href=\"mailto:techfest@sliet.ac.in\">techfest@sliet.ac.in<\/a><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Follow Us for Updates:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Instagram and other social media platforms<\/p>\n<p><strong>For Queries:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Naman Kumar Sinha (Overall Coordinator): +91 78568 93952<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Shubham Kumar Singh (Overall Coordinator): +91 97711 74465<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Prepare yourself for a journey of technology, creativity, and celebration.<\/p>\n<p>Mark your calendars and be part of the magic of techFEST'26 at SLIET.<\/p>\n<p>We cordially invite you to Chemi-Thone, organised as part of <strong>techFEST'26<\/strong> - Annual Technical Festival of SLIET. Showcase your talent, compete with the sharpest minds and earn your moment of glory.<\/p>\n<p><strong>''Innovation grows when curious minds come together.''<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>About the Event:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Chemi-Thone is a fast-paced industrial problem-solving challenge that encourages creativity, technical thinking, and real-world application.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Participants will tackle an industry-related issue and propose innovative, practical solutions under a tight deadline.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Number of Rounds:<\/strong> 2<\/p>\n<p><strong>Round 1: Problem Solving<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Participants will be given an industry-related problem statement.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Teams must brainstorm, analyze, and submit their innovative solutions the same day.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Format: Written or digital submission.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Evaluation: Based on innovation, feasibility, and technical relevance.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Shortlisting: Best teams will be selected for the final stage.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Finalists will be shortlisted based on merit list and will proceed to the final round.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Round 2: Idea Presentation<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Shortlisted teams will present their proposed solutions to a panel of judges.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Format: Live presentation (with slides).<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Judging Criteria:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Technical depth<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Feasibility of solution<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Clarity and structure of presentation<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Creativity and innovation<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Rules &amp; FAQs:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Open to all undergraduate and diploma students with valid institutional ID.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Team size: Maximum 3 members per team.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Participants can use the internet and refer to books, articles, or any reliable sources to develop their solutions or ideas.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Direct copying from any source (websites, books, or other teams) without credit or presenting it as original work is strictly prohibited.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>If plagiarism (copy-paste or copied ideas without originality) is found, the team will be disqualified.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Certification Policy:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Certificates will be provided to all participants.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Certificate of Excellence will be provided to the winners (as per the results declared by the judges).<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Important Note:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>The organizers reserve the right to modify the rules, prize pool, dates, venue, or timing of the competition if deemed necessary under unforeseen circumstances.<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>All guidelines are subject to change. Participants are advised to regularly check the official techFEST'26 website for any updates. Any changes or announcements will be posted there. Adherence to the latest rules is mandatory for all teams.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>The details mentioned in this Problem Statement may be subject to change at any time.<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>For Further Query:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Domain Advisor:<\/strong> Sahil Sinha, 2432067\/GCT, 9065297749<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Domain Coordinator:<\/strong> Amit Kumar, 254013105\/GCT, 8010064068<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Event Coordinator:<\/strong> Isha, 2442013\/GCT, 9467809305<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Rules and Regulations - General Rules:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>All participants must carry a valid college ID card and their techFEST'26 registration receipt.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Reporting time will be communicated to registered teams; late reporting may lead to walkover.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>The decision of the judges and organisers will be final and binding in all matters.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Any form of misconduct, plagiarism or use of unfair means leads to immediate disqualification.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Participants are responsible for their own equipment and personal belongings.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Organisers reserve the right to modify any rule at any time; updates are announced at the venue.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Eligibility:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Open to students of all institutes and all degree programmes (unless specified otherwise in the event rules above).<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Participants must be registered for techFEST'26 through the official portal.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p>Cross-college teams are welcome.<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Mark your calendars and be part of the magic of techFEST'26 at SLIET!<\/p>","overall_prizes":"Prize pool worth \u20b9 10,000","regn_open":1,"regn_type":1,"regn_url":null,"regn_email":null,"registration_clicks":0,"user_id":27463276,"moderation_status":1,"overall_leaderboard":0,"reject_reason":null,"display_date":null,"created_at":"2026-08-25T20:45:47+05:30","updated_at":"2026-10-06T21:30:13+05:30","communication_sent":null,"certificate_at":null,"remarks":null,"branding":0,"disable_auto_rounds":null,"certificate_config":null,"subtype":"general_competition","combined_leaderboard":null,"source":null,"short_id":"1hMXYpB","hashtags":null,"participation_certificate":1,"winner_certificate_at":null,"listed":1,"self_moderated":2,"prizes_release_days":null,"checked":2,"display_title":null,"show_discussions_only_user":1,"show_reviews_only_user":1,"show_score_card":0,"players_count":57,"referral_leaderboard_show":0,"is_ad_free":0,"enable_gamify_leaderboard":0,"tpo_college_id":null,"publish_at":"2026-08-27 03:54:07","auto_shortlist_trigger":false,"enable_ai_discussion":false,"total_unlock_teams":0,"enable_hiring_automation":false,"a